  "text": {
    "TXT_KEY_TECH_CARD_CULTURAL_ANNEXATION": "Cultural Annexation",
    "TXT_KEY_TECH_CARD_CULTURAL_ANNEXATION_HELP": "[ICON_BULLET]World spell, once a game: Cultural Annexation.[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Target: a city of another civilization or of the barbarians. Not a capital. Within 3 plots of your borders. Your culture is at least 30% of the culture on its plot.[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]The city joins you with its buildings. No war is declared. Its owner gets -4 attitude toward you.",
    "TXT_KEY_TECH_CARD_CULTURAL_ANNEXATION_PEDIA": "The city that already half belongs to you.",
    "TXT_KEY_SPELL_CULTURAL_ANNEXATION": "Cultural Annexation",
    "TXT_KEY_SPELL_CULTURAL_ANNEXATION_HELP": "[ICON_BULLET]Target: a city of another civilization or of the barbarians. Not a capital. Within 3 plots of your borders. Your culture is at least 30% of the culture on its plot.[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]The city joins you with its buildings. No war is declared.[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Effect: -4 attitude toward you, for its owner."
  }
}
